WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:08.290
In September of 1994, more than 60 children at the Ariel Primary School in Zimbabwe

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.290
witnessed a strange silver object land outside the playground,

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:15.250
and were approached by small black beings with large entrancing eyes.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.760
The children's stories alarmed their teachers, and aroused the curiosity of the BBC

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.980
and the esteemed Harvard psychiatrist, John E. Mack,

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:29.920
while the common elements in the children's stories suggest that the object and the beings were physically

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.870
real. The many divergent details, and the kids' highly personal reactions, suggest that there are

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:39.730
many subjective elements to UFO and entity encounters that we don't yet understand.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:48.520
The Aerial Primary School is a private institution in the agricultural community of Rua,

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:56.160
22 kilometers outside of Harare, the capital city of Zimbabwe. The school was founded by

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.160
area farmers in 1991, and by 1994,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.460
It had more than 200 students from grades 1 to 7, or from 6 to 12 years old.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:10.940
The students were a racially diverse group, though most of them were from wealthier farming families.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.330
Friday, September 16th was a clear and warm sunny day.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:24.040
During the regular 10.30am recess, all of the teachers were attending a staff meeting inside the school,

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:29.180
and only one adult was outdoors, operating a tuck shop or snack store on the playground.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.860
Shortly after recess began, the tuck shop attendant, Allison Kirkman,

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:38.220
volunteer and mother to one of the Ariel's students,

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:42.980
said that a bunch of kids ran into the shop and told her about a little black man on the playground.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.440
Kirkman thought that the kids were trying to trick her, and refused to leave the shop.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.920
Shortly after, dozens of children rushed into the school,

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.780
screaming about a landed craft outside the schoolyard,

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.100
and little black men with big black eyes.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:04.100
The teachers could tell that the kids were deeply frightened,

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.160
but they could not believe what they were saying.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.200
The school's headmaster, Colin Mackey,

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:13.920
sat the students down and had them each produce a drawing of the things they saw,

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.240
as well as a written account of their experiences.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:21.550
These efforts committed the children's earliest memories to record,

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:24.620
and created crucial documentation for later investigators.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.140
Shortly after classes ended and the kids were sent home for the weekend,

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:37.450
teachers saw several parents searching the ground at the edge of the schoolyard with their children.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:43.680
The yard was virtually empty, with minimal grass, no trees or bushes,

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.400
and only a few play structures near the classrooms.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.800
The children said that the beings appeared beyond the fence at the furthest point from the school,

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.220
not a place where the children typically played.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.960
Beyond this fence was a field covered in brush and...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.530
short trees. There was nothing there that could have been mistaken for a UFO or entity, and no

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:13.600
indication that anything had been there at all. The following Monday, the school was inundated

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.460
with letters from parents asking what had happened to their children on Friday that made them so

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:24.410
frightened and upset. Several students were traumatized, and did not return to school for

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:29.970
several days after the event. That week,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.580
Tim Leach, senior correspondent with the BBC, visited the school,

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.540
and other African news outlets picked up the story as well,

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:41.110
including South African and Zimbabwean state television channels.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:47.470
Leach spoke with the children, and had them tell their stories for the first time on video.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:53.650
He found that they were all genuinely shaken, and was convinced that they believed what they were saying.

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:59.960
Leach later claimed that despite all his experience as a war reporter, it was the

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.000
aerial school incident that frightened him most.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:09.330
Cynthia Hind, a MUFON field investigator and editor of UFO AfroNews,

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:11.450
was the first ufologist on the case.

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:18.280
Gunter Hofer, an electronics enthusiast and acquaintance of Hind's, accompanied her,

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:24.560
and swept the yard with a Geiger counter, a metal detector, and a magnetometer, with no unusual finds.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.590
The team also sent ground samples to the University of Zimbabwe,

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:29.750
We'll be right back.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:38.240
returned with no significant anomalies. Whatever the children saw, if anything, were then only memories.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:46.700
After reviewing their drawings on first-written accounts, Hind interviewed 62 of the witnesses

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:50.260
grades 3 and up, and spoke with the school's teachers and administrators.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:56.940
Dr. John E. Mack, the noted Harvard Medical School psychiatrist and ufologist,

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.960
was visiting Africa at the time to explore the abduction phenomena.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:08.680
and visited Ariel's school. He spent two days talking with the kids, accompanied by his assistant

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:12.680
and a South African TV camera operator who filmed some of the interviews.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:22.760
Hind and Mack found that the witnesses' stories conflicted on many details, but converged on a few key claims.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:29.760
Most students had agreed that a round, elliptical-shaped silver-coloured object appeared among some trees

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.660
just beyond the boundary of the schoolyard.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.590
The object had a lustrous surface, and a bright white or golden glow.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.300
Most of the students only saw the object on the ground,

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:46.040
but some claimed to have seen it flying over top of the schoolyard before landing.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:52.960
The object glowed brightly from its landing place, attracting the kids' attention,

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.260
so they ran towards the fence to investigate.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:59.920
At this point, one or two small

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.060
black beings approximately one meter tall emerged from the object.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:07.530
Some kids said that one paced back and forth on the ground,

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.650
and others said that they saw one on the object doing the same thing.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.650
The being on the ground then began to move towards the students.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:21.570
The beings were mostly black, with pale faces,

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:24.850
and huge elongated black eyes that were angled inwards.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:29.760
Very few of the students reported any other details about the beings' faces.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.120
though at least one saw a nose and mouth.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:38.960
12-year-old Liesel and 8-year-old Emily remember the being hovering over the ground rather than walking,

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:41.160
though others described it taking steps.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.670
Emily said that the two beings hopped alongside her and Liesel,

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:50.060
as if to imitate the girls skipping on the playground, though their feet never touched the ground.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:57.090
After covering a short distance, the figure or figures stopped and stared at the children,

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.450
who all felt compelled to stare back and return.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.980
Emily said that the two beings she saw appeared in front of her instantaneously.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:11.940
At this point, some of the students began to feel that the beings were communicating with them telepathically,

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.520
and a few students felt a rush of wind blow by.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.070
Several children saw visions of environmental catastrophe.

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:25.560
Liesl said that she saw a vision of Earth after all trees had been cleared,

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.970
and there was no air left to breathe, and received a non-verbal warning about humans' dis-

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:38.150
the planet. Another student saw visions of polluted oceans. Emily saw a quick succession

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:43.430
of still images, showing scenes of the environment in crisis, and was urged to use technology more

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:50.680
responsibly. Another student, Emma, received a similar message about humanity's destructive use

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:54.360
of technology, and given the imperative that we mustn't get too acknowledged.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:59.650
11-year-old Salma was holding Emma's hand during the encounter.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:02.650
and yet she has no memory of any communication at all,

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.380
though she felt that the being was gazing into her soul, as she put it.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:13.100
Both Salma and Emily have stated that they felt that time was distorted for the duration of the encounter.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:17.920
Salma said that although she tried to run to the protection of her younger siblings,

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.580
she was unable to break eye contact with the being.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:27.180
After several minutes of staring at the children, perhaps as many as fifteen,

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.970
the encounter abruptly ended, and the intrusion

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:36.600
disappeared. At least one student said that he saw the beings climb back inside the object

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:41.350
and fly away again, but most said that the beings and the UFO simply vanished on the spot.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:47.180
Emily claimed that they disappeared the instant that the bell rang for the end of recess,

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:55.580
and her sense of reality immediately returned to normal. Though many of the students agreed on

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:59.900
these details, there was a considerable amount of variation in their stories, and some

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:06.780
outright contradiction. Some students reported seeing the black entities, but not the silver object.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:12.060
Other students described the object in vivid detail, but had no recollection of the entities.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:18.030
Some students nearby to the action even said that they saw nothing at all.

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.420
Multiple students attested to seeing a cluster of objects flying in the air,

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:29.860
while others were adamant that they saw only one. As Hind noted,

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:34.230
Although most of the students identified the object as some sort of vessel or craft,

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:40.830
they could not agree on its appearance. Students variously drew windows, doors, lights,

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:49.210
cockpits, landing gear, and many combinations of the above. Two boys said that it had stripes of

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:55.690
black and green, others that there was a platform around the outside. One child drew it red.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.920
Most agreed, however, that it was generally

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:07.140
elliptical in shape. There were also several different accounts of how the object arrived on

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:12.840
the ground. Several noted that they saw flashes of bright, colorful lights above their heads

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:17.080
before the sighting, and at least two students claimed to have heard loud noises in the sky.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:26.480
One student even described a flute-like sound. Another student claimed to have witnessed the

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.980
object in several auxiliaries flying along some electricity wires beside the

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:36.510
the schoolyard before landing in the field. He said that they flew over him with flashing red

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:40.930
lights, disappearing and reappearing elsewhere in the sky several times before landing.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.810
Other students drew the object flying overhead in their illustrations as well.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.280
There was generally more agreement on the appearance of the UFOnauts,

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:59.830
but accounts varied here as well. Some described the figures as having long black hair, while other

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.800
Some students claimed to have seen no hair at all.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:08.550
One student described the beings as looking like little plump humans, with long, straight hair,

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:11.710
though Emily saw beings with long necks and spindly limbs.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.340
Some students claimed that the beings wore skin-tight garments or shiny suits,

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.170
and others thought that they were naked, with black skin.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.540
One child claimed that the figures looked just like a shadow.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.600
Another young girl said that there were three beings,

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.720
in black, red, and white.

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:38.360
While most teachers admitted to being initially skeptical of the children's stories,

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:42.030
they later came to realize how profound the experience had been for the witnesses.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:49.310
The aerial school headmaster acknowledged that he believed that the children saw something,

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:53.220
but suggested that some of their recollections were products of their imaginations.

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:58.830
However, other teachers were more sympathetic to the children's claims.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:04.640
It was difficult for them to accept that the children's imaginations had caused them all

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:08.260
to conjure up such a strange experience, and to react so dramatically.

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:14.540
The teachers were generally convinced that the students could not have faked their hysteria

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:18.490
when running into the school that morning, and that no one could have forced dozens of children

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:22.880
to play along with the same hoax. Hind agreed.

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:29.460
Mack was also convinced that the students had shared an authentic experience, and that it was unlikely

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:29.980
if they had been in the middle of the school,

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.540
if not impossible, that they had all staged a hoax.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:39.730
Here, these are people of sound mind, by and large, telling me something that's very,

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:46.450
they know that I might think they're crazy, and so they're a little concerned about telling me,

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:50.870
and they're very full of questioning themselves and doubt,

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:58.420
and the whole quality of the way they talk about it is the way a person talks about experience that happened to them.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.300
were not the only ones to see strange things around Rua and Harare.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.520
On the morning of the kids' encounter, a woman who owned a farm near the school

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.630
saw a bright orange ball of light outside her chicken coop.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:18.800
The day before, a mother and her son reported seeing a craft ahead of their car,

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.880
around the same time that three aerial students saw an object

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.920
shaped like a cigarette above the school yard.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.970
And the day before that, thousands of people across eastern Africa

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.960
saw massive lights in the sky.

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:37.680
Many of these sightings were probably due to a meteor shower in the area,

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:42.280
but Hind received calls and letters from numerous people asserting that they had seen a fireball

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.460
with a tail of sparks and smaller lights.

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:52.500
Like many UFO and entity encounters, the aerial school incident appears to have been part of a broader wave of sightings.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:59.980
Hind and Mack's research on the aerial incident was never published,

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.240
as a formal report.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:06.840
Hein shared some details on the case in UFO AfroNews in 1995,

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.960
and more in her 1996 book, UFOs Over Africa.

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:15.950
Mack was killed by a drunk driver in 2004,

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.620
before publishing any of his work on the incident.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:23.750
After his death, Mack's family created the John E. Mack Institute,

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.890
which hired filmmaker Randall Nickerson to produce a film

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.690
based on Mack's involvement with the case.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:35.380
Nickerson went on to find Tim Leach, as well as several of the aerial school witnesses,

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:40.360
then in their mid to late 20s, and arranged a reunion in Los Angeles in 2013.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.460
He has also organized a number of public appearances and media interviews

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:48.020
to help the aerial school witnesses share their stories.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:55.360
Nickerson's film, Aerial Phenomenon, is now complete and seeking distribution.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:59.960
There is no

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.020
There is no doubt that the aerial school student saw something unusual that day, but what it was is still unclear.

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:12.720
Nothing about the object or the entities suggested a particular origin, either on Earth or in outer space.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:20.700
The beings conformed in many ways to the image of the grey visitors popularized by Whitley-Strieber's communion in 1987,

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:27.690
but differed greatly in other ways, including in the presence of hair, squat bodies, and black skin or body suits.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:35.400
Still, they were similar to other commonly encountered entities in the sense that they only stood about a meter tall.

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:45.330
Nickerson has also claimed at a public talk that many of the children's stories were extremely bizarre and highly illogical.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:52.380
For example, he spoke of one student who said that he saw one of the black beings approach across the field,

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:57.710
then vanish, and instantly reappear where it started, only to repeat the exact same approach.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:05.690
Perhaps the numerous discrepancies in the children's accounts were due to their failures to accurately recall what they'd seen.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.590
After all, it's well known that human memory is extremely faulty,

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:14.480
especially when memories are formed under stressful and traumatic circumstances.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:22.070
Alternatively, the discrepancies in the children's accounts may reflect real differences in the things themselves,

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:24.650
or in the children's perception of those things,

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:27.670
rather than simply differences in their recollection of those things.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.300
Ufologist John Keel proposed that UFOs were vessels for ultra-terrestrials,

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:39.460
or interdimensional beings, that could somehow manipulate how they appeared, or how we perceived them.

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:45.610
Jacques Vallée made a similar argument in suggesting that UFOs are both physically real

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:50.220
and culturally constructed, either by some mind-interfacing technological operation,

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.610
or a collective act of psychic projection.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:59.960
These considerations have moved some ufologists to focus attention away from the strictly material aspect of

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.180
of the UFO phenomenon, and towards their effects on witnesses.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:09.760
Nickerson, too, has focused on the effects that this event has had on witnesses,

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:13.930
and his documentary offers a fuller view of the ways in which it changed them.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:18.930
It was a dark and frightening experience for the majority.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:24.910
One student said that the being looked evil, as if it wanted to come and take the kids.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:29.970
Many of the younger children said that they feared that the little men were coming

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:36.890
to eat them. Liesl told Mack that when she got home that day, she felt horrible inside,

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:41.260
describing an anxiety about humans not treating the environment with enough respect.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.450
Still, years later, many of the students contacted by Nickerson and other journalists

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.510
claim that it was a powerful and transformative experience for them

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.830
that initiated lifelong changes in their openness to new ideas

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:59.820
and their general sense of purpose. For example,

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.580
Salma pursued degrees in international relations and human rights law,

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.620
and claims that the incident taught her to believe her own experiences,

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.680
regardless of what other people thought of them.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.280
Liesl became a social support worker.

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:18.030
She said that she has always felt a strong duty to give back and do her part since the incident.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:24.830
Emily began producing art, with pieces that frequently feature otherworldly beings.

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.970
Mac made similar kinds of observations of abductees.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:36.920
or experiencers, in general. He claimed that many experiencers seek out more fulfilling,

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:41.270
outreach-based jobs after their encounters, become better stewards of the environment,

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:47.450
and develop a greater sense of spirituality. It's difficult to imagine that the students

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:52.010
could have effected these changes on the basis of a mistaken sighting or an imagined incident.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.970
What is particularly striking about the Ariel School case is the sh**

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.080
sheer number of witnesses, and the diversity of the student body.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:08.790
The fact that none of the witnesses have gone back on their claims, or confessed to a hoax,

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:13.400
even after more than 25 years, is a huge point in favour of their veracity.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:20.970
Witnesses such as Salma, Liesl, and Emily continue to speak about their experiences

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.970
at public events and on a variety of media platforms,

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:29.490
but while there's no doubt that the kids saw something highly unusual that day…

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.900
The discrepancies in their accounts also suggest that there was a strong subjective component to their experiences.

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:41.810
Whatever the kids at Ariel School saw that morning, it moved them on a very deep level,

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:46.340
and affected lasting changes in their lives. And maybe that was the point.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:19:59.980
Last year, the kids at Ariel School saw that morning, it moved them on a very deep level, and affected lasting changes in their lives.

